omx-contract (3.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * release: the 3.4.0 changelog names the owner floors
  * release: omx-contract 3.4.0
  * package-files: omx_contract.py lands in omx-contract-data
  * Render the format identifiers to C, ts and py; export validate()
  * Render a reply code's resp number as OMX_REPLY_<CODE>_RESP, so a host
    defines no refusal number by hand (plugin-hostd#176)
  * semver: leave the tool files out of a tag's data, so codes.json is not
    read as removed (#104)
  * Install the OpenMixer repository from the openmixer-release package

